  _sectionNumber: 3
  _sectionName: Game Story
  _title: A child, a father, and a trade
  _kicker: "Damietta \u2014 fishing, carpentry, ship-building"
  _speakerNotes: "Keep this short \u2014 20 seconds. The art section does the persuading,
    not this slide."
  _background: {fileID: 0}
  _transitionIn: {fileID: 0}
  _layout: 2
  _body: 'Dumyat is Damietta: a coastal city at the mouth of the Nile that lives
    on fish, timber and boats. You play a child of a Damietta family, learning your
    father''s trades by doing them with your hands rather than by reading about them.'
